]]></Declaration>
    <Method Name="getRootNodeName" Id="{896c8991-6879-4618-9613-f86d6ecb3cc2}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This method returns the instance path of the root node of the operation mode handler.
It is used for the HMI tree building mechanism.

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
| SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)

{attribute 'TcRpcEnable'}
METHOD getRootNodeName : Tc2_System.T_MaxString
]]></Declaration>
    </Method>
