    <Property Name="step" Id="{e10dcd66-f5a4-43fe-954a-2c7ac9b42981}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This property setter sends the step signal to all nodes of the machine.
If the step mode is enabled, the step signal will be set for exactly one PLC cycle.
If the step mode isn't enabled, the step signal won't have any effect at all.

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
| SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)

{attribute 'monitoring':='call'}
PROPERTY step : BOOL

]]></Declaration>
      <Set Name="Set" Id="{ea65fe25-1e6c-4aca-93f7-f4a3760b7d18}">
        <Declaration><![CDATA[]]></Declaration>
      </Set>
